==Trivia==
*The Evolved Royal Ghost is the first card evolution to be released in the same season as another card evolution since [[Cannon/Evolution|Evolution Cannon]], which released alongside [[Musketeer/Evolution|Evolution Musketeer]] in November 2024.
*The Evolved Royal Ghost is the only card to have different card images according to the player's language settings.

